  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Rehabilitation program 2024</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Congenital heart diseases are one of the leading causes of death not only in Bulgaria, but also in the world. In Bulgaria, about 600 children are born annually with congenital heart malformations. About 400 heart operations are performed annually. Rehabilitation programs create an environment in which children feel safe to examine new behaviors and to build skills. They become an adults that are visible and included into the society life. They change attitudes.</narrative>
  </description>
